## Architecture notes

- **App Router** — all pages and layouts in `app/`. No `pages/` directory.
- **Server Components** — the default; add `'use client'` only when required.
- **Security headers** — set in `next.config.ts` for all routes.
- **Health probe** — `GET /api/health` returns `{status: 'ok', project: '{{.Name}}'}`.
- **TypeScript strict mode** — `"strict": true`; no `any`.

